<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>تموينات أبو حسين | Supplies & Prestige</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-[#05070a] text-white min-h-screen pb-32">

    <audio id="snd-click" src="https://assets.mixkit.co/active_storage/sfx/2568/2358-preview.mp3" preload="auto"></audio>
    <audio id="snd-cashier" src="https://assets.mixkit.co/active_storage/sfx/592/592-preview.mp3" preload="auto"></audio>
    <audio id="snd-notification" src="https://assets.mixkit.co/active_storage/sfx/911/911-preview.mp3" preload="auto"></audio>

    <div class="blob"></div>
    <div class="blob-2"></div>

    <header class="sticky top-0 z-[1000] bg-[#05070a]/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-white/5 px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-500 to-teal-400 p-[1px] shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20">
                <div class="w-full h-full bg-[#05070a] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
                    <span class="text-emerald-400 font-black text-sm">خط</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="font-black text-xs text-slate-100 tracking-tight">تموينات أبو حسين</h1>
                <p class="text-[9px] text-emerald-400/80 font-bold">Line Services & Supplies</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <button id="refresh-btn" onclick="manualRefresh()" class="w-9 h-9 bg-white/5 border border-white/5 text-slate-400 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center active:scale-90 transition duration-300">
            <i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-xs"></i>
        </button>
    </header>

    <main class="px-6 mt-6 space-y-6">

        <div id="ad-banner-container" class="hidden transition-all duration-500"></div>

        <div id="view-home" class="view-panel space-y-6">
            
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-slate-950/60 p-2 rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold pr-2">تخصيص نمط التخطيط المرئي</span>
                <div class="flex gap-1">
                    <button id="btn-layout-0" onclick="setLayout(0)" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xs bg-emerald-500 text-black transition duration-200"><i class="fas fa-th-large"></i></button>
                    <button id="btn-layout-1" onclick="setLayout(1)" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-slate-400 transition duration-200"><i class="fas fa-th"></i></button>
                    <button id="btn-layout-2" onclick="setLayout(2)" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-slate-400 transition duration-200"><i class="fas fa-bars"></i></button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-black text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fas fa-tags text-emerald-400"></i> أقسام التموينات الفورية
                </h2>
                <div id="categories-chips" class="flex gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-2 scrollbar-none"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3">
                <h2 class="font-black text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fas fa-gamepad text-emerald-400"></i> نظام الشحن التلقائي والفوري للألعاب
                </h2>
                <div id="games-grid-container" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
                <h2 class="font-black text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fas fa-cubes text-emerald-400"></i> الخدمات والمنتجات المتوفرة بالسيرفر
                </h2>
                <div id="categories-list" class="cards-container mode-dual pb-12"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="view-orders" class="view-panel space-y-4 hidden">
            <h2 class="font-black text-sm text-slate-200 text-right mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-receipt text-emerald-400"></i> أرشيف الفواتير السابقة للمشترك</h2>
            <div id="orders-list" class="space-y-3 pb-12"></div>
        </div>

        <div id="view-notifications" class="view-panel space-y-6 hidden">
            <h2 class="font-black text-sm text-slate-200 text-right flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-bell text-emerald-400"></i> صندوق البرقيات والرسائل الإدارية</h2>
            
            <div class="bg-slate-900/40 p-5 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 space-y-4">
                <h3 class="font-black text-emerald-400 text-xs flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-comments"></i> مراسلة الإدارة والعمليات المركزية</h3>
                <div class="flex gap-2">
                    <input type="text" id="support-msg-input" class="flex-1 bg-black/60 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-3 text-xs outline-none text-white text-right placeholder-slate-600" placeholder="اكتب رسالتك وتفاصيل طلبك هنا...">
                    <button onclick="sendSupportMessage()" class="bg-emerald-500 text-black font-black px-5 rounded-xl text-xs active:scale-95 transition duration-200">إرسال</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="notifications-list" class="space-y-3 pb-12"></div>
        </div>

        <div id="view-account" class="view-panel space-y-6 hidden">
            
            <div id="auth-section" class="bg-slate-900/30 p-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 space-y-4 text-right">
                <h2 id="auth-title" class="font-black text-sm text-emerald-400">تسجيل الدخول للمنظومة</h2>
                
                <div id="auth-name-box" class="space-y-2 hidden">
                    <label class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold block">الاسم الكامل للمشترك</label>
                    <input type="text" id="auth-name" class="w-full bg-black/50 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-3 text-xs text-right outline-none text-white" placeholder="أدخل اسمك الثلاثي">
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-2">
                    <label class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold block">رقم الهاتف المعتمد</label>
                    <input type="tel" id="auth-phone" class="w-full bg-black/50 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-3 text-xs text-right outline-none text-white" placeholder="77xxxxxxx">
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-2">
                    <label class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold block">كلمة المرور السرية</label>
                    <input type="password" id="auth-pass" class="w-full bg-black/50 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-3 text-xs text-right outline-none text-white" placeholder="••••••••">
                </div>
                <button onclick="handleAuth()" id="auth-submit-btn" class="w-full bg-emerald-500 text-black font-black py-3 rounded-xl text-xs transition duration-200">دخول آمن</button>
                <div class="text-center pt-2">
                    <button id="auth-toggle-btn" onclick="toggleAuthMode()" class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-black underline">إنشاء حساب مشترك جديد</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="profile-section" class="space-y-6 hidden">
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-950 to-slate-900 p-6 rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 text-right relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
                    <span class="text-[9px] font-black text-slate-500 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/5">المحفظة الرقمية المعتمدة</span>
                    <div class="mt-4">
                        <h3 id="user-display-name" class="font-black text-base text-slate-200">--</h3>
                        <p id="user-display-phone" class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-bold mt-0.5">--</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex justify-between items-end">
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold">الرصيد المتاح حالياً</span>
                        <div>
                            <span id="user-display-balance" class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-400">0</span>
                            <span class="text-xs font-black text-emerald-500 mr-1">YER</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button onclick="logout()" class="w-full bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 font-black py-3.5 rounded-xl text-xs border border-red-500/10 transition duration-300">تسجيل الخروج من الحساب</button>
            </div>
        </div>

    </main>

    <div class="fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-[2000] bg-[#05070a]/90 backdrop-blur-2xl border-t border-white/5 px-4 pb-safe-bottom">
        <nav class="flex justify-around items-center h-20">
            <button onclick="changeView('home', this)" class="nav-item text-emerald-400"><i class="fas fa-store text-base"></i><span>المتجر الفوري</span></button>
            <button onclick="changeView('orders', this)" class="nav-item"><i class="fas fa-receipt text-base"></i><span>فواتيري</span></button>
            <button onclick="changeView('notifications', this)" class="nav-item relative">
                <i class="fas fa-bell text-base"></i><span>الرسائل</span>
                <span id="msg-dot" class="hidden absolute top-4 right-5 w-2 h-2 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full animate-ping"></span>
            </button>
            <button onclick="changeView('account', this)" class="nav-item"><i class="fas fa-user-circle text-base"></i><span>حسابي</span></button>
        </nav>
    </div>

    <div id="toast" class="fixed bottom-28 left-6 right-6 z-[4000] bg-emerald-500 text-black px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl text-xs font-black shadow-2xl text-center hidden animate-slideUp"></div>

    <div id="sheet-overlay" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/95 z-[1500] hidden" onclick="closeSheet()"></div>
    <div id="product-sheet" class="fixed bottom-[-100%] left-0 right-0 z-[1600] bg-[#05070a] border-t border-white/10 rounded-t-[3rem] p-10 transition-all duration-500">
        <img id="sh-img" class="w-full h-64 object-cover rounded-[2.5rem] mb-6">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start text-right">
            <div>
                <h2 id="sh-name" class="font-black text-sm text-slate-100">--</h2>
                <span id="sh-cat" class="text-[9px] text-slate-500 font-bold bg-white/5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md mt-1.5 inline-block">--</span>
            </div>
            <span id="sh-price" class="text-xs font-black text-emerald-400">0 YER</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
            <button onclick="handleOrderSubmit()" class="w-full bg-emerald-500 text-black font-black py-4 rounded-xl text-xs transition duration-200 active:scale-95">تأكيد طلب الشراء الفوري من المحفظة</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="game-topup-sheet" class="fixed inset-0 z-[3000] bg-black/95 flex items-end hidden">
        <div class="w-full bg-[#05070a] border-t border-white/10 rounded-t-[3rem] p-8 space-y-5 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <button onclick="closeGameSheet()" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-slate-400"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button>
                <h2 id="game-title" class="font-black text-sm text-slate-200">شحن الحزمة الفورية للاعب</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-2 text-right">
                <label class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold">أدخل معرف اللاعب (Player ID) بشكل صحيح:</label>
                <input type="text" id="game-user-id" class="w-full bg-black/50 border border-white/5 rounded-xl p-3.5 text-xs text-center text-emerald-400 font-black tracking-widest outline-none" placeholder="100484930">
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-3">
                <label class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold block text-right">اختر كمية أو فئة الحزمة المطلوبة:</label>
                <div id="denom-list" class="space-y-2"></div>
            </div>
            <button onclick="validateAndPayGame()" class="w-full bg-emerald-500 text-black font-black py-4 rounded-xl text-xs transition duration-200 active:scale-95">تثبيت عملية الشحن التلقائي فوراً</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

